#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/internal_transfers.rst:22
msgid "When money is transferred from one bank or cash account to another, that amount appears as two transactions on the corresponding journals, whether the transactions are created manually, via import, or via :doc:`bank synchronization <bank_synchronization>`. When reconciling the transaction, select the :guilabel:`Internal Transfers` :doc:`reconciliation model <reconciliation_models>` button. This reconciliation model button writes the transaction off to the :guilabel:`Internal Transfer` account."
