#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/austria.rst:7
msgid "Odoo Invoicing is your trusted partner for safe, efficient, and legally compliant e-invoicing solutions tailored to Austria's regulatory standards, and compatible with the European `Peppol <https://peppol.org/about/>`_ framework."
