#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:134
msgid "Some accounting reports require **tags** to be set on the relevant accounts. To add a tag, open the account, click the :guilabel:`Tags` field, and select an existing tag or create a new one."
