#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:141
msgid "Account groups"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:143
msgid "**Account groups** are useful to list multiple accounts as *sub-accounts* of a bigger account and thus consolidate reports such as the **Trial Balance**. By default, groups are handled automatically based on the code of the group. For example, a new account `131200` is going to be part of the group `131000`. You can attribute a specific group to an account in the :guilabel:`Group` field of the account form."
