msgid "Then, define the :guilabel:`Tax Cash Basis Journal`. To update the journal's default properties such as the :guilabel:`Journal Name`, :guilabel:`Type` or :guilabel:`Short Code`, open the journal from :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`."
