msgid ":guilabel:`Journal Entries` section:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:45
msgid ":guilabel:`Journal`: the journal in which the depreciation entries are posted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:46
msgid ":guilabel:`Asset Account`: the account used to record the purchase of the asset at its original price."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:48
