#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:99
msgid "Expense reports can **only** be refused on the individual expense report, and **not** from the :guilabel:`All Reports` dashboard. To open an individual expense report, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> Expense Reports`, then click on an individual expense report to view the detailed expense report form."
