#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:125
msgid "To refuse an expense report, click :guilabel:`Refuse`, and a :guilabel:`Refuse Expense` pop-up window loads. Enter a brief explanation for the refusal on the :guilabel:`Reason` line, then click :guilabel:`Refuse`."
