msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_reports.rst:10
msgid "All expenses are color-coded by status. Any expense with a status of :guilabel:`To Report` (expenses that still need to be added to an expense report) appears in blue text. For all other statuses (:guilabel:`To Submit`, :guilabel:`Submitted`, and :guilabel:`Approved`) the text appears in black."
